    "detailed_description": "This game is a modern twist on block crumbling.<br>It is a puzzle RPG with RPG battle elements and a growth system.<br>Break blocks to get skill points, spend skill points to strengthen your abilities, and strengthen your armor to become stronger!<br>Destroy the sassy TOKAI Girl's costumes (clothing) completely and open up the best romance scenes!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/fde6b969ae971d38bbc8dd6d76a557b5.avif?t=1727118683\" width=382 height=240 /></span><br>Use the command-selection RPG-style interface to reduce the girls' HP to 0!<br>The girls' damage reactions are a highlight of this game!<br>The more you reduce their HP, the more their armor will break down.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Romance Scene</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/2c1ebb0708c29f2eca815ce578fc6a18.poster.avif?t=1727118683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/2c1ebb0708c29f2eca815ce578fc6a18.webm?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/2c1ebb0708c29f2eca815ce578fc6a18.mp4?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/9b65d5531cc29a1d29d2d1a812f3caaf.poster.avif?t=1727118683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/9b65d5531cc29a1d29d2d1a812f3caaf.webm?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/9b65d5531cc29a1d29d2d1a812f3caaf.mp4?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/93601b1b693cb99386d5bb7608b7d4da.poster.avif?t=1727118683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/93601b1b693cb99386d5bb7608b7d4da.webm?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/93601b1b693cb99386d5bb7608b7d4da.mp4?t=1727118683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy interactive scenes with text and animation.<br>You're sure to be excited by the beautiful illustrations and smooth, lifelike animation!<br>7 fully animated scenes in total<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Shop and Blacksmith</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/4598a43c6367403b0df1e869ef0aa8cc.avif?t=1727118683\" width=382 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/adb13fd25aeefa41f40e0befc5b5fbcc.avif?t=1727118683\" width=382 height=240 /></span><br>Strengthen your skills and aim to defeat the Girls!<br>You can increase the number of times you can use your skills by spending skill points (SP) earned in battle at the skill shop.<br>Some skills can evolve in function, so keep strengthening them.<br>You can purchase armor at the blacksmith.<br>Purchased armor can be equipped to increase your defensive power.<br>It will protect you from the Girls' super powerful attack, &quot;Brutal Hit.&quot;<br>You can also strengthen purchased equipment by spending Gold.<br>Even if you lose once, don't be discouraged - strengthen your armor and challenge the Girls again and again.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Shop</h2></strong><br>You can purchase potions at the item shop.<br>Potions increase your maximum HP and allow you to withstand stronger attacks.<br>They only take effect once per battle stage, and their effects will not disappear until the end of the battle.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2></strong><br><br>\u3000<strong>YUKI</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/990f409964c83a6f925cc29566d6b2df.avif?t=1727118683\" width=182 height=182 /></span><br>Participates in block-breaking battles to earn money for his younger brother's medicine.<br>Although he is weak and timid, he has a love that would do anything for his younger brother.<br><br>\u3000<strong>LILITH</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/48591e7b7368d6fd30178a1865fc2d8a.avif?t=1727118683\" width=184 height=184 /></span><br>A modern man who has been lost in another world. <br>He joins a battle to return to his original world. <br>He is an eccentric man who keeps tentacles as pets even in his original world.<br><br>\u3000<strong>MIKI</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/0fca2416b1b426b41fe6521d36053680.avif?t=1727118683\" width=184 height=184 /></span><br>She possesses the special power to transform into a magical girl.<br>She loves justice and is cheerful and active, but she also easily gets carried away and her foul mouth often brings trouble upon herself.<br>She has extremely large breasts.<br>She is surprisingly shy and has no experience dating a man.<br><br>\u3000<strong>LINDEL</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001920/extras/84c74d5f81bde4cbf5df95e1e98b6892.avif?t=1727118683\" width=184 height=184 /></span><br>An elf whose home village was overrun by orcs.<br>He participates in this block-breaking battle to find and kill the orc who violated his mother.<br>He makes fun of humans, calling them inferior.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill List</h2>Split\uff08Evolution\uff09<br>\tSplitting Ball<br><br>Fireball<br>\tPenetrating ball<br><br>Recovery\uff08Evolution\uff09<br>\tHP Recovery<br><br>Shield<br>\tA shield that prevents the ball from being lost just once.<br><br>Laser\uff08Not for sale\uff09<br>\tStretch out in a straight line and destroy the block in front<br><br>Paddle long\uff08Not for sale\uff09<br>\tThe paddle operated by the player extends sideways.<br><br>Paddle Short\uff08Not for sale\uff09<br>\tThe paddle operated by the player becomes shorter.<br><br>Adsorption\uff08Not for sale\uff09<br>\tThe ball sticks to the paddle<br><br>Bind Resist<br>\tGirls' counterattack, relaxing action restrictions due to weights",
